  "plain": "An astronomer named J. Allen Hynek, who worked on Blue Book (the US Air Force's UFO study of the 1950s and 60s), is said to have later admitted that he \"played a part in the cover up\". Michels tells it himself without naming a source, describing Hynek as \"running\" Blue Book. If true, it would mean the scientist at the heart of the Air Force study knew it was hiding something."
